# Playwright E2E files are not Meteor app code -- they must not be swept
# into Meteor's build (client or server bundle, or `meteor test`). Without
# this, files outside imports/ are eagerly loaded by Meteor, and Playwright's
# test.describe() blocks fail at eval time outside a Playwright test run.
e2e/
playwright.config.js
playwright-report/
test-results/
